@@ -3,3 +3,28 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental service
+
+`createRentalService()` creates an isolated, in-memory rental module. Register a board or sail with an
+integer euro-cent daily price, then quote or book half-open day ranges expressed as midnight-UTC
+ISO-8601 timestamps:
+
+```ts
+import { createRentalService } from './src/index.js';
+
+const rentals = createRentalService();
+rentals.addEquipment({ id: 'board-1', kind: 'board', dailyPrice: 2_500 });
+
+rentals.quote({
+  itemId: 'board-1',
+  start: '2026-06-10T00:00:00Z',
+  end: '2026-06-13T00:00:00Z',
+});
+// { itemId: 'board-1', start: '...', end: '...', total: 7500 }
+```
+
+The end timestamp is the start of the day after the final rental day. Bookings for the same item may
+be adjacent but cannot overlap. Quotes and bookings reject unknown equipment and invalid periods.
+Cancellation is not yet exposed; when it is added, bookings cancelled less than 24 hours before their
+start will receive no refund, and all other cancellations will receive a full refund.
